  "description": "All our experience designing and riding steel and alloy track frames has culminated in the birth of the BLB Viper - an embodiment of evolution.\n\nCrafted from 6061 double butted aluminium, the Viper will launch from the gates and continue the attack through the corners of the course - the 35mm tapered fork ensures you stay on track whether fighting through switchbacks or busy city traffic.\n\nThe integrated seat post keeps weight down while increasing rigidity - rigidity that extends downwards into a burly BB shell, transferring 100% of your power to explosive sprints and summit killing climbs.\n\nSupplied with headset and seat clamp. Please note - a WHITE seat clamp will be supplied with European Orders.\n\nIntegrated seat post can be cut depending on preferences.",
